# DO big-fish.cnc-ddraw
#
# For a game Big Fish sells that draws with DirectDraw, after the wine
# module's cnc-ddraw (DO wine.cnc-ddraw): cnc-ddraw hooks the Windows
# functions themselves (hook=2, Microsoft Detours) rather than the game's
# imports. Armadillo, which wraps every Big Fish edition, unpacks the game
# and rebuilds its imports after cnc-ddraw has patched them, so the game read
# the unscaled mouse: on a fullscreen display the cursor sat at the picture's
# edge and no click reached the menu.
FUNCTION cnc-ddraw
  EDIT C:/windows/syswow64/ddraw.ini --keys-must-exist --ini=ddraw.hook=2
END
